# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 4 (a building `match` or `if` picks its arm once, at the build, and adds no path segment) and ch. 8 (the arm's places take the block's next positions): `@Choose`'s label is 1 and its `match`'s widest arm has two places, so the `if` stands at 4 and the last label at 5 whichever arm is built (pick CS); the arm's button is the line's event.
